id: pm-http-0wf8
title: Standardize the release gate on owner approval with a daily release schedule
description: "The caller still carries the pre-approval gate: no daily schedule, only the hourly reconcile, and release-enabled reads a package-specific repository variable that is not set. The owner has approved the package: it is first-published on npm and PM_RELEASE_APPROVED is set, so the caller moves to the fleet standard used by pm-brand and pm-glossary."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-11-16T14:44:29.645Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-16T16:02:01.534Z"
assignee: codex-sol
claim_principal: codex-sol
author: pi-glm
acceptance_criteria: "The caller schedules a daily release cron next to the hourly reconcile; release-enabled requires the exact repository, main and vars.PM_RELEASE_APPROVED; The pinned reusable workflow SHA and its version comment stay unchanged; The workflow-contract tests assert the new gate and keep every other assertion"
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-16T15:18:51.964Z",codex-sol,"Continuation: verified the existing worktree and remote branch state, preserved the earlier changes, and reused this item. Rerunning required gates to completion under the continuation author before committing results."
  "2026-11-16T15:25:12.152Z",codex-sol,"Root cause: only hourly reconciliation was scheduled, and release admission depended on an unset package-specific variable. Per owner approval, the npm first publish of @unbrained/pm-http and PM_RELEASE_APPROVED=true permit the standard daily caller. Added the daily cron and exact repository/main/owner-approval condition while preserving the reusable SHA, version comment, permissions and all other caller assertions."
  "2026-11-16T15:42:17.187Z",codex-sol,The first combined gate command hit its 20-minute timeout during shared-host disk contention and is not pass evidence. Retrying all gates to completion using memory-backed temporary fixtures and the existing harness deadline scale. Assertions and test selection are unchanged.
  "2026-11-16T15:57:54.575Z",codex-sol,"Workflow contracts passed. changelog:check then correctly required the new in-progress item in the generated changelog; regenerated it with the package generator and verified the diff is limited to this item entry. Rechecking the contracts and changelog together."
  "2026-11-16T16:02:01.528Z",codex-sol,"Before publication: typecheck and lint completed successfully. The focused workflow contract suite passed 7 tests, and changelog:check passed after generating the required in-progress item entry. The first full quick test command timed out under disk contention; its replacement is active and remains pending evidence. Publishing a draft for exact-head CI validation."
